# What the body of a module makes out of the text alone and only stores in a variable of the module is made at the first read of the variable.
# Left as they are: a closure (g16), a variable that is assigned to (g19), an object that the body itself goes on to use (g20), a closure that captures (g22), what a loop makes (g23), and a variable that a record hands to the run time (g12).
# RUN: plan deferred mechanisms=all
